{"3584350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dreamcraft: Lumberjack", "steam_appid": 3584350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> CUT TREES 🪓</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam around the forests cutting sick trees, getting rid of corruption to save the forests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/2c0e9584878ae0d9969ccbff56f86987.poster.avif?t=1783039126\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/2c0e9584878ae0d9969ccbff56f86987.webm?t=1783039126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/2c0e9584878ae0d9969ccbff56f86987.mp4?t=1783039126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GET BETTER 💪</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell lumber, upgrade your axes and improve your statictics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/ec8e45911c5a052cf0f773198101ca3e.poster.avif?t=1783039126\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/ec8e45911c5a052cf0f773198101ca3e.webm?t=1783039126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/ec8e45911c5a052cf0f773198101ca3e.mp4?t=1783039126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESCUE ANIMALS 🐕</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help and save animals along the way, Your best friend will help you on your adventures! Improve his statistics and unlock new skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/48bda32f1fcc956f21c03961262319f6.poster.avif?t=1783039126\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/48bda32f1fcc956f21c03961262319f6.webm?t=1783039126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/48bda32f1fcc956f21c03961262319f6.mp4?t=1783039126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESTORE NATURE</strong>🌳</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch how your actions in matter of seconds have impact on environment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/e8cc4160516c385ef126533f73b72232.poster.avif?t=1783039126\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/e8cc4160516c385ef126533f73b72232.webm?t=1783039126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/e8cc4160516c385ef126533f73b72232.mp4?t=1783039126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Cutting trees is easier with Axes, but I can't stop now. Doge is my friend now, great game 10/10&quot; - Bober<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/ab42e509108b5ea95a299fb5f45233ce.avif?t=1783039126\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>FEATURES ROADMAP </strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those are features that will come to the game at some point</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chainsaws &amp; Something bigger 🦾</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescuing more animals that help your cause 🐶</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More biomes and trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization to different aspects of the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> CUT TREES 🪓</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam around the forests cutting sick trees, getting rid of corruption to save the forests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/2c0e9584878ae0d9969ccbff56f86987.poster.avif?t=1783039126\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/2c0e9584878ae0d9969ccbff56f86987.webm?t=1783039126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/2c0e9584878ae0d9969ccbff56f86987.mp4?t=1783039126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GET BETTER 💪</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell lumber, upgrade your axes and improve your statictics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/ec8e45911c5a052cf0f773198101ca3e.poster.avif?t=1783039126\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584350/extras/ec8e45911c5a052cf0f773198101ca3e.webm